If a patient receives a prescribed-opioid from an additional-prescriber then every clinician should review a state-PDMP-record for the patient and should assess a combined-opioid-dosage for an overdose-risk and should assess a medication-combination for an overdose-risk.
If a patient receives an other-controlled-medication from an additional-prescriber then every clinician should review a state-PDMP-record for the patient and should assess a medication-combination for an overdose-risk.
